      "source_text": "我飞快地浏览了一边目白阿尔丹给我的资料，\r\n并且大致拟出了新的训练方案。\r\n在我打算去找樱花千代王商量一下时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b8435c31ea0b65cd9d30a21871a11b91d552aa78d2562b250d22be59a52ab8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069301.json",
      "json_path": [
