    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f636915be9b06e8144c9e55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千代王同学。前几日邀你同去观战阿尔丹同学\r\n的模拟战，是我欠考虑了。非常抱歉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f8720916c5c73c91a3e97bff02774a6e98cb011f990adb92b652f7f2577261",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069301.json",
      "json_path": [
