    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4152a8be64bfea8cb4db04da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……正是。\r\n我等『金刚八重垣流』，乃是为“守护”而\r\n将武道特化至极致之活人拳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c6db1b2dc4195fdc422833dd586136ef664ffa4d90176de6d0fc93b1cb8666",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069301.json",
      "json_path": [
