    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccf09f8be9f45dc210112e0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是所谓“守护”，并非意味着绝不“破坏”。\r\n有时，我们也不得不破坏一些东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04e53b8ac5548a7ff05e1fd5d27efe6dce2a4291179f7b8d79a5caf4d3ca1b69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
