    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62de1d6d0e1e66563fd65aff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在吾师将我引领上正途之时，\r\n也将我原本走上的歧路彻底粉碎，\r\n这才开辟了我应走的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c9175bf6bb1396e75a5ed4466be51800e48c933b6df517f5d735de0cd3a8c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069301.json",
      "json_path": [
