    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c412de6fc05a2355cf169018",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她们却敏锐地察觉到了异样，\r\n并且主动出手帮助了千代王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d496737a3e620c4075301b0735328fb8e798ed9dbedf9b5e26e0ad05f88c2af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
