    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8a793274677cdd4c490191",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……果然，我还是不能就这样止步不前。\r\n为了我的两个劲敌，\r\n也为了能够成为那个人的劲敌……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8466687406acf2f933a7f86d6c6b6d3d011b00f4340215855b36c4cb5ba32af4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
